IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sgd-amalgamation`
IMPORT `sg-proc-amalgamation`

-- Tests for sg-proc-amalgamation.l4 (ss 215A to 215H of the Companies Act 1967: the chain of amalgamation, with the short form of s 215D).
-- Every expected outcome below was written from the text (src:21068-21511 of CoA1967.txt) before the module was run, never copied from its output.
-- A trace that does not match is a finding. Day 0 of each trace is the start day of the trace, 1 January 2026.
-- Days used: the general meeting on 1 March 2026 is day 59; the day before it, 28 February, is day 58; 21 days before it, 8 February, is day 38;
-- the amalgamation becomes effective on 1 April 2026, day 90, so the last day for the application to the Court is 31 March, day 89; 22 March is day 80.

§ `Helpers: deadlines turned into days`

#ASSERT `s 215 chain: the days from the start day to the day before the general meeting` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS 58
#ASSERT `s 215 chain: the days from the start day to the day before the general meeting` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 1 2 2026) EQUALS 27
#ASSERT `s 215 chain: the days from the start day to the last day not less than 21 days before the general meeting` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS 38
#ASSERT `s 215 chain: the days from the start day to the day of the general meeting` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS 59
#ASSERT `s 215 chain: the days from the start day to the day before the date on which the amalgamation becomes effective` (Date 1 4 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS 89
#ASSERT `s 215 chain: the days from the start day to the day before the date on which the amalgamation becomes effective` (Date 1 4 2026) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS 30

§ `Cases`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `amalgamation chain act`
`case: the long-form duties before the meeting of 1 March 2026` MEANS
    `s 215C chain: the duties before the general meeting` "Alpha" "Dana" (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 1 1 2026)

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `amalgamation chain act`
`case: the short-form duties before the meeting of 1 March 2026` MEANS
    `s 215D chain: the duties before the general meeting` "Alpha" "Dana" (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 1 1 2026)

GIVEN `the amalgamated company is a new company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the documents filed are those section 215E(1) requires` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `what the person who applies is` IS A `s 215H(1) the person`
      `the Court is satisfied` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the day of the application` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `amalgamation chain act`
`case: the long-form chain from the resolution, the amalgamation effective on 1 April 2026` MEANS
    `s 215 chain: the members' resolution, the filing, the Registrar's steps and the Court's power` FALSE (Member "Members") (Company "Alpha") `the amalgamated company is a new company` `the documents filed are those section 215E(1) requires` (Creditor "Bank") `what the person who applies is` `the Court is satisfied` `the day of the application` (Date 1 4 2026) (Date 1 1 2026)

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `amalgamation chain act`
`case: the short-form chain from the resolution, the amalgamation effective on 1 April 2026` MEANS
    `s 215 chain: the members' resolution, the filing, the Registrar's steps and the Court's power` TRUE (Member "Members") (Company "Alpha") FALSE (JUST TRUE) (Creditor "Bank") `s 215H(1) a creditor of an amalgamating company` TRUE (Date 22 3 2026) (Date 1 4 2026) (Date 1 1 2026)

GIVEN `the answer of the short-form gate` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `amalgamation chain act`
`case: the whole chain, the meeting on 1 March 2026 and the amalgamation effective on 1 April 2026` MEANS
    `s 215 chain: the whole amalgamation` `the answer of the short-form gate` "Alpha" "Dana" (Date 1 3 2026) (Member "Members") (Company "Alpha") FALSE (JUST TRUE) (Creditor "Bank") `s 215H(1) a creditor of an amalgamating company` TRUE (Date 22 3 2026) (Date 1 4 2026) (Date 1 1 2026)

§ `s 215C(2) to (5): the long-form duties before the general meeting`

-- Every duty done in time: the board resolves and makes both statements (before day 59), the director signs, the board sends to every member, the directors send to every secured creditor and publish (by day 38).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the long-form duties before the meeting of 1 March 2026` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(a) the board resolves that the amalgamation is in the best interest of the amalgamating company` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(b) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company` AT 11
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(c) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company` AT 12
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(3) the director signs the declaration` AT 20
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(4) the board sends the proposal, the declarations, the statement of interests and the further information to every member` AT 30
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(5)(a) the directors send the proposal to every secured creditor` AT 30
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(5)(b) the directors cause the notice to be published in a daily English newspaper` AT 35

-- The last day of each limit: the sending and the publication on day 38 (21 days before the meeting), the resolution and the statements on day 58 (the day before the meeting).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the long-form duties before the meeting of 1 March 2026` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(3) the director signs the declaration` AT 5
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(4) the board sends the proposal, the declarations, the statement of interests and the further information to every member` AT 38
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(5)(a) the directors send the proposal to every secured creditor` AT 38
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(5)(b) the directors cause the notice to be published in a daily English newspaper` AT 38
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(a) the board resolves that the amalgamation is in the best interest of the amalgamating company` AT 58
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(b) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company` AT 58
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(c) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company` AT 58

-- The board sends to the members on day 39, one day after the last day: a breach of subsection (4).
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: the long-form duties before the meeting of 1 March 2026` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(a) the board resolves that the amalgamation is in the best interest of the amalgamating company` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(b) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(c) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company` AT 10
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(3) the director signs the declaration` AT 10
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(5)(a) the directors send the proposal to every secured creditor` AT 30
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(5)(b) the directors cause the notice to be published in a daily English newspaper` AT 30
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(4) the board sends the proposal, the declarations, the statement of interests and the further information to every member` AT 39

-- The board resolves on the day of the meeting (day 59), which is not "before the general meeting": a breach of subsection (2)(a).
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: the long-form duties before the meeting of 1 March 2026` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(b) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(c) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company` AT 10
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(3) the director signs the declaration` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(4) the board sends the proposal, the declarations, the statement of interests and the further information to every member` AT 30
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(5)(a) the directors send the proposal to every secured creditor` AT 30
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(5)(b) the directors cause the notice to be published in a daily English newspaper` AT 30
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(a) the board resolves that the amalgamation is in the best interest of the amalgamating company` AT 59

-- No solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company by the end of day 58: a breach of subsection (2)(c).
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: the long-form duties before the meeting of 1 March 2026` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(a) the board resolves that the amalgamation is in the best interest of the amalgamating company` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(b) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company` AT 10
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(3) the director signs the declaration` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(4) the board sends the proposal, the declarations, the statement of interests and the further information to every member` AT 30
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(5)(a) the directors send the proposal to every secured creditor` AT 30
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(5)(b) the directors cause the notice to be published in a daily English newspaper` AT 30
    (WAITUNTIL 59)

-- The copy is not sent to the secured creditors by day 38: a breach of subsection (5)(a).
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: the long-form duties before the meeting of 1 March 2026` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(a) the board resolves that the amalgamation is in the best interest of the amalgamating company` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(b) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(c) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company` AT 10
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(3) the director signs the declaration` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(4) the board sends the proposal, the declarations, the statement of interests and the further information to every member` AT 30
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(5)(b) the directors cause the notice to be published in a daily English newspaper` AT 30
    (WAITUNTIL 39)

-- The notice is not published by day 38: a breach of subsection (5)(b).
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: the long-form duties before the meeting of 1 March 2026` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(a) the board resolves that the amalgamation is in the best interest of the amalgamating company` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(b) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(c) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company` AT 10
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(3) the director signs the declaration` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(4) the board sends the proposal, the declarations, the statement of interests and the further information to every member` AT 30
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(5)(a) the directors send the proposal to every secured creditor` AT 30
    (WAITUNTIL 39)

-- Only the resolution is made, and day 20 is before every limit: the other duties are open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `case: the long-form duties before the meeting of 1 March 2026` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(a) the board resolves that the amalgamation is in the best interest of the amalgamating company` AT 10
    (WAITUNTIL 20)

-- Everything is done in time except the director's declaration, which subsection (3) gives no last day: it stays open, and nothing is breached.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `case: the long-form duties before the meeting of 1 March 2026` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(a) the board resolves that the amalgamation is in the best interest of the amalgamating company` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(b) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(2)(c) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215C(4) the board sends the proposal, the declarations, the statement of interests and the further information to every member` AT 30
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(5)(a) the directors send the proposal to every secured creditor` AT 30
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215C(5)(b) the directors cause the notice to be published in a daily English newspaper` AT 30
    (WAITUNTIL 60)

§ `s 215D(3), (5), (6): the short-form duties before the general meeting`

-- The notice to the secured creditors on day 38, the last day; the solvency statement on day 59, the day of the meeting (before it starts); the declaration signed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the short-form duties before the meeting of 1 March 2026` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215D(6) the director signs the declaration` AT 10
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215D(3) the directors give written notice of the proposed amalgamation to every secured creditor` AT 38
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215D(5) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company` AT 59

-- The notice to the secured creditors on day 39, one day late: a breach of subsection (3).
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: the short-form duties before the meeting of 1 March 2026` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215D(6) the director signs the declaration` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215D(5) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company` AT 20
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215D(3) the directors give written notice of the proposed amalgamation to every secured creditor` AT 39

-- The solvency statement on day 60, after the meeting: a breach of subsection (5).
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: the short-form duties before the meeting of 1 March 2026` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215D(6) the director signs the declaration` AT 10
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215D(3) the directors give written notice of the proposed amalgamation to every secured creditor` AT 20
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215D(5) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company` AT 60

-- The notice to the secured creditors is never given: a breach once day 38 has passed.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: the short-form duties before the meeting of 1 March 2026` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215D(6) the director signs the declaration` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215D(5) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company` AT 20
    (WAITUNTIL 39)

-- The declaration of subsection (6) is not signed, and it has no last day: the duty is open, with the notice and the statement done.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `case: the short-form duties before the meeting of 1 March 2026` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director "Dana" DOES `s 215D(3) the directors give written notice of the proposed amalgamation to every secured creditor` AT 10
    PARTY `Board of directors` "Alpha" DOES `s 215D(5) the board makes the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company` AT 20
    (WAITUNTIL 60)

§ `s 215C(1)(a), 215D(1), 215E to 215H: from the members' resolution to the Court`

-- The members approve on day 59, the company files on day 60, the Registrar issues the notice on day 65, the company applies for the certificate on day 70 and it is issued on day 72, the Registrar removes the companies on day 95.
-- Nobody applies to the Court, and the window closed on day 89, before the last step.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the long-form chain from the resolution, the amalgamation effective on 1 April 2026` FALSE (JUST TRUE) `s 215H(1) a creditor of an amalgamating company` TRUE (Date 22 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Members" DOES `s 215C(1)(a) the members approve the amalgamation proposal by special resolution at a general meeting` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215E(1) the amalgamating company files the documents with the Registrar with the prescribed fee` AT 60
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(1)(a) the Registrar issues the notice of amalgamation` AT 65
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215F(4) the amalgamated company applies for a certificate of confirmation of amalgamation` AT 70
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(4) the Registrar issues the certificate of confirmation of amalgamation` AT 72
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(3) the Registrar removes the amalgamating companies, other than the amalgamated company, from the register` AT 95

-- The same, but the trace stops on day 80, with the Court window still open and the removal not made: open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `case: the long-form chain from the resolution, the amalgamation effective on 1 April 2026` FALSE (JUST TRUE) `s 215H(1) a creditor of an amalgamating company` TRUE (Date 22 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Members" DOES `s 215C(1)(a) the members approve the amalgamation proposal by special resolution at a general meeting` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215E(1) the amalgamating company files the documents with the Registrar with the prescribed fee` AT 60
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(1)(a) the Registrar issues the notice of amalgamation` AT 65
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215F(4) the amalgamated company applies for a certificate of confirmation of amalgamation` AT 70
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(4) the Registrar issues the certificate of confirmation of amalgamation` AT 72
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(3) the Registrar removes the amalgamating companies, other than the amalgamated company, from the register` AT 80

-- A creditor applies to the Court on day 80 (22 March), before the date of effect; the Court directs that effect must not be given, on day 85.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the long-form chain from the resolution, the amalgamation effective on 1 April 2026` FALSE (JUST TRUE) `s 215H(1) a creditor of an amalgamating company` TRUE (Date 22 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Members" DOES `s 215C(1)(a) the members approve the amalgamation proposal by special resolution at a general meeting` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215E(1) the amalgamating company files the documents with the Registrar with the prescribed fee` AT 60
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(1)(a) the Registrar issues the notice of amalgamation` AT 65
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215F(4) the amalgamated company applies for a certificate of confirmation of amalgamation` AT 70
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(4) the Registrar issues the certificate of confirmation of amalgamation` AT 72
    PARTY Creditor "Bank" DOES `s 215H(1) the person applies to the Court` AT 80
    PARTY Court DOES `s 215H(1)(a) the Court directs that effect must not be given to the amalgamation proposal` AT 85
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(3) the Registrar removes the amalgamating companies, other than the amalgamated company, from the register` AT 95

-- The same application, the Court modifies the proposal (paragraph (b)).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the long-form chain from the resolution, the amalgamation effective on 1 April 2026` FALSE (JUST TRUE) `s 215H(1) a creditor of an amalgamating company` TRUE (Date 22 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Members" DOES `s 215C(1)(a) the members approve the amalgamation proposal by special resolution at a general meeting` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215E(1) the amalgamating company files the documents with the Registrar with the prescribed fee` AT 60
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(1)(a) the Registrar issues the notice of amalgamation` AT 65
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215F(4) the amalgamated company applies for a certificate of confirmation of amalgamation` AT 70
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(4) the Registrar issues the certificate of confirmation of amalgamation` AT 72
    PARTY Creditor "Bank" DOES `s 215H(1) the person applies to the Court` AT 80
    PARTY Court DOES `s 215H(1)(b) the Court modifies the amalgamation proposal` AT 85
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(3) the Registrar removes the amalgamating companies, other than the amalgamated company, from the register` AT 95

-- The same application, the Court directs a reconsideration (paragraph (c)).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the long-form chain from the resolution, the amalgamation effective on 1 April 2026` FALSE (JUST TRUE) `s 215H(1) a creditor of an amalgamating company` TRUE (Date 22 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Members" DOES `s 215C(1)(a) the members approve the amalgamation proposal by special resolution at a general meeting` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215E(1) the amalgamating company files the documents with the Registrar with the prescribed fee` AT 60
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(1)(a) the Registrar issues the notice of amalgamation` AT 65
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215F(4) the amalgamated company applies for a certificate of confirmation of amalgamation` AT 70
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(4) the Registrar issues the certificate of confirmation of amalgamation` AT 72
    PARTY Creditor "Bank" DOES `s 215H(1) the person applies to the Court` AT 80
    PARTY Court DOES `s 215H(1)(c) the Court directs the amalgamating company or its board to reconsider the amalgamation proposal` AT 85
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(3) the Registrar removes the amalgamating companies, other than the amalgamated company, from the register` AT 95

-- The same application, the Court makes some other order it thinks fit.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the long-form chain from the resolution, the amalgamation effective on 1 April 2026` FALSE (JUST TRUE) `s 215H(1) a creditor of an amalgamating company` TRUE (Date 22 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Members" DOES `s 215C(1)(a) the members approve the amalgamation proposal by special resolution at a general meeting` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215E(1) the amalgamating company files the documents with the Registrar with the prescribed fee` AT 60
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(1)(a) the Registrar issues the notice of amalgamation` AT 65
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215F(4) the amalgamated company applies for a certificate of confirmation of amalgamation` AT 70
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(4) the Registrar issues the certificate of confirmation of amalgamation` AT 72
    PARTY Creditor "Bank" DOES `s 215H(1) the person applies to the Court` AT 80
    PARTY Court DOES `s 215H(1) the Court makes any other order it thinks fit in relation to the amalgamation proposal` AT 85
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(3) the Registrar removes the amalgamating companies, other than the amalgamated company, from the register` AT 95

-- The application is made, and the Court has not yet acted, on day 85: the Court's power is open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `case: the long-form chain from the resolution, the amalgamation effective on 1 April 2026` FALSE (JUST TRUE) `s 215H(1) a creditor of an amalgamating company` TRUE (Date 22 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Members" DOES `s 215C(1)(a) the members approve the amalgamation proposal by special resolution at a general meeting` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215E(1) the amalgamating company files the documents with the Registrar with the prescribed fee` AT 60
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(1)(a) the Registrar issues the notice of amalgamation` AT 65
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215F(4) the amalgamated company applies for a certificate of confirmation of amalgamation` AT 70
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(4) the Registrar issues the certificate of confirmation of amalgamation` AT 72
    PARTY Creditor "Bank" DOES `s 215H(1) the person applies to the Court` AT 80
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(3) the Registrar removes the amalgamating companies, other than the amalgamated company, from the register` AT 85

-- The application is made on day 89 (31 March), the last day: in time. The Court acts after the date of effect, which the text allows (no limit on the Court).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: the long-form chain from the resolution, the amalgamation effective on 1 April 2026` FALSE (JUST TRUE) `s 215H(1) a creditor of an amalgamating company` TRUE (Date 31 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Member "Members" DOES `s 215C(1)(a) the members approve the amalgamation proposal by special resolution at a general meeting` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215E(1) the amalgamating company files the documents with the Registrar with the prescribed fee` AT 60
