    PARTY Member "Members" DOES `s 215C(1)(a) the members approve the amalgamation proposal by special resolution at a general meeting` AT 59
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215E(1) the amalgamating company files the documents with the Registrar with the prescribed fee` AT 60
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(1)(a) the Registrar issues the notice of amalgamation` AT 65
    PARTY Company "Alpha" DOES `s 215F(4) the amalgamated company applies for a certificate of confirmation of amalgamation` AT 70
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(4) the Registrar issues the certificate of confirmation of amalgamation` AT 72
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 215F(3) the Registrar removes the amalgamating companies, other than the amalgamated company, from the register` AT 95

